  "body": "https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/9952/files is an interesting case we should perhaps offer some advice on in the specification. In that if you have some `postMessage()`-based protocol, you cannot rely on the replies coming in some order if you communicate with multiple sites, due to out-of-process `<iframe>`.",
